{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1111209001:2":{"text":"我可不想欺负小孩！总之，我一定要带安丹德拉离开，这是我唯一的目的！","source_cn":"我可不想欺负小孩！总之，我一定要带安丹德拉离开，这是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD863A1ADCABAB69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111209002:1":{"text":"萨忒娜，这些孩子非常需要我，你能理解才对。","source_cn":"萨忒娜，这些孩子非常需要我，你能理解才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB67AA82B5BBC1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111209003:2":{"text":"我也很需要你！可当年你还不是抛下我一走了之？你太偏心了！","source_cn":"我也很需要你！可当年你还不是抛下我一走了之？你太偏心了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AB5FE23AF910367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111209004:1":{"text":"我那时没有别的选择……","source_cn":"我那时没有别的选择……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB465CFDDB75D297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111209005:1":{"text":"我知道你会照顾好自己。你是个聪明又勇敢的好孩子，一直都是。","source_cn":"我知道你会照顾好自己。你是个聪明又勇敢的好孩子，一直都是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2AE495B3384B27F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":""